# Playwright visual-regression baselines ARE version-controlled: toHaveScreenshot
# needs a committed reference to diff against, and they're generated in the exact
# CI container image (apps/store/playwright.config.ts → mcr…playwright:jammy) so
# they match. Re-include them despite the broad *.png ignores above. (Parent dirs
# aren't ignored — only the *.png files — so negation is allowed here.)
!apps/store/e2e/**/*-snapshots/
!apps/store/e2e/**/*-snapshots/**

# apple-touch-icon.png is a required runtime asset (referenced in index.html),
# not a screenshot — re-include it despite the broad *.png ignores.
!apps/store/public/apple-touch-icon.png

